# armour/man/mail_hang: the hauberk's skirt in the side walk and run (MAN-WEAR, P2B rollout, 2026-10-22). armour/man/mail's
# side run views end at the tunic's hem, so the legs' hipline is judged where the tunic's is (B11 limbs HIPLINE); the two
# skirt rows under it ride the hip here: `wide` (the walk's contact and down frames) is the run view's last two rows pixel
# for pixel, `flare` (the run) the leaning run view's (the lean drawn, the back corner trailing a pixel). The reach frames
# (hang=rest, the frozen idle key) take the same rows from mail_stride; every rest view is empty, so idles, hurts, falls,
# swings and postures draw exactly as before (the idle's knee skirt is mail.pxm's own rest view). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR i3) the 1px checker re-laid as STYLE_P2 25.2's brick: lit side courses yyx / xyy (steps 3/2), shadow side xww / wwx
# (steps 2/1), alternate rows offset, so mail reads as rings and a fine grey fabric, never a chessboard (the blind panel).
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) mail as lit planes with a sparse ring dot (mailfix.py), as the hauberk
use person
body man
role armour mail
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key flare origin 0 0
|.

view U key flare origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key wide origin 6 -1
|vyxyyxxwwxwv.
|vyyyxyxxwwwwv
regions
|.............
|.RRRRR.......
build
|...+.........

view R key flare origin 7 -1
|.vyxyyxxwwxwv.
|vyyyxyxxwxwwwv
regions
|..............
|.RRRRRR.......
build
|....+.........

view L key rest origin 0 0
|.

view L key wide origin 8 -1
|.vyyxywwxwwxwv
|vyyyxyxxwxwwwv
regions
|..............
|.RRRRRR.......
build
|..........+...

view L key flare origin 8 -1
|.vyyxywwxwwxwv.
|vyyyxyxxwxxwwwv
regions
|...............
|.RRRRRR........
build
|..........+....

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) the lying key (the lying skirt is the torso's lie view)
view L key lie origin 0 0
|.
